      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلَبٌ</span></b>  a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَلَبٌ</span>; (M;) <i>Helmets of
camels' shins:</i> or, as some say, it signifies <i>steel:</i>
(T:) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلَبَةٌ</span> is [its n. un., being] a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَلَبَةٌ</span>.
(K, * TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَلَبٌ</span>.]

